 r←Test_Input_DataType_001(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT
⍝ Exercise "Input" with data type "Time".
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 7⍴''

 defMat⍪←'TimeInt' 'Int' 81234 DT.Time 0 1 1            ⍝ Integer
 defMat⍪←'TimeFloat' 'Float' 0.081234 DT.Time 0 1 1     ⍝ Float
 defMat⍪←'TimeChar' 'Char' '08:12:34'DT.Time 0 1 1      ⍝ Char
 defMat⍪←'TS' 'TS'(1999 1 1 2 3 4 5)DT.Time 0 1 1       ⍝ Timestamp

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat ⍬ ⍬
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.∆OK'Select'
 0.5 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →FailsIf 1≠⍴,↑n.∆result[0;1]
 →FailsIf 0≠1↑0⍴↑n.∆result[0;1]
 →FailsIf 1≠⍴,↑n.∆result[1;1]
 →FailsIf 0≠1↑0⍴↑n.∆result[1;1]
 →FailsIf 8≠⍴,↑n.∆result[2;1]
 →FailsIf' '≠1↑0⍴↑n.∆result[2;1]
 →FailsIf 7≠⍴↑n.∆result[3;1]

 r←∆OK
